      "partOfSpeech": "verb",
      "meaning": "妨げる",
      "definition": "interrupt the normal way something works",
      "contextParagraphId": "p1",
      "context": "Global life expectancy recovered to 73.3 years in 2023, almost exactly the 73.4 years recorded in 2019, before the pandemic disrupted health systems and daily life.",
